# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GENERATED AUDIO. Both are rebuilt on first run from edge-tts, and together
# they are 280MB — an order of magnitude more than the entire source tree.
_voice_cache/
_voice_tmp/
stings/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE USER'S OWN CAREER. Somebody else's championship, driver name, inbox and
# story state. A tester who receives these inherits a stranger's career.
careers/
_career.json
_career.json.v6bak
_settings.json
_bag.json

# LEARNED FROM THIS MACHINE. `_modnames.json` is what the local rF2 install
# calls each mod — it is correct here and wrong everywhere else, and it is
# rebuilt from the game's own cache on first run.
_modnames.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOGS AND PREVIEWS. Every one of these is an output of a tool in the repo, so
# shipping them adds size and invites somebody to read a stale one as current.
_session_log.txt
_transcript.log
_career_preview.txt
_menu_old.txt
_*_preview.png
_*_preview_*.png
_logo_halo*.png

__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
dist/
*.spec
